			"Message": "build(Project): Coordinate Element submodule updates across 3 components\n\nSynchronize Element submodule to 6b50bc7 bringing coordinated changes:\n- Mountain: Streamline extension path and NodeResolver module documentation — simplify ScanPathConfigure comments, condense NodeResolver docstring to compact resolution order ladder. No runtime changes.\n- Wind: Split monolithic PostHogBridge.ts into modular components under Source/Telemetry/PostHog/ — Browser.ts (window.posthog lookup), Configuration.ts (import.meta.env config), Fallback.ts (fetch POST fallback), Identifier.ts (distinct_id resolution), Properties.ts (base event properties). PostHogBridge.ts now composes these for improved testability.\n- Cocoon: Submodule updated to 33544546.\n\nThis coordinated update delivers documentation improvements and modular telemetry architecture while maintaining identical runtime behavior.",
